      "no archetype indexed solely by ethnicity — country-of-birth appears as soft filter in remote_tech_migrant only",
      "personality_bias values are RELATIVE OFFSETS to LANE_COVE_PROFILE.personality_params mean (0.5), not absolute",
      "2026-05-10 (B1 audit): 4 fallback archetypes added (young_renter_commuter / mid_renter_family / older_renter_downsizer / casual_shift_worker) to cover ~68% unmatched profiles. Tagged uncertain=true; deeper Lane Cove research is V2.",
      "2026-05-10: Added 'everyday_adult' generic catch-all to push match rate ≥ 80% — covers profiles outside archetype-specific patterns. Acceptable as breath of coverage; depth comes from archetype-specific archetypes when applicable (match_archetype prefers specific over generic via score order)."
